WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.224
A failing test tells
you something is wrong.

2
00:00:03.224 --> 00:00:05.920
You still need to find out what caused it.

3
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:12.063
The shout test fails. Diagnosis
nudge adds a reminder to the result,

4
00:00:12.063 --> 00:00:15.286
asking for evidence behind
the suspected cause.

5
00:00:15.286 --> 00:00:20.360
The agent reads the helper and sees it
ignores the option the test passes.

6
00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:28.382
Check the cause before you edit.

7
00:00:28.382 --> 00:00:32.220
That gives you a reason to
expect your next change to help.
